@page "/"

<PageTitle>SXA-RTX Analytics — ECCSA</PageTitle>

<section class="rtx-hero p-4 p-lg-5 mb-4">
    <div class="row align-items-center g-4 rtx-hero-grid">
        <div class="col-lg-7">
            <div class="rtx-kicker mb-3"><span class="rtx-kicker-dot"></span> Fase 1 • Bootstrap completado — 9/9 tests</div>
            <h1 class="display-5 mb-3">SXA-RTX<br />Analytics</h1>
            <p class="lead mb-4">
                Plataforma interna de reporting — <strong>estilo VTIVTECH chibi mecha</strong>.<br />
                Tanques <span class="badge rounded-pill" style="background:var(--rtx-honey);color:#5A3D00">PROPANO</span>
                <span class="badge rounded-pill bg-white text-dark border">OTRO</span>
                <span class="badge rounded-pill" style="background:#D9E2EC">CHÍMICO</span> listos para conectar.
            </p>
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <a href="/health" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Ver /health →</a>
                <a href="https://github.com/hector1516/SXA-RTX-Analytics" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg rounded-pill" style="border-width:2px">GitHub</a>
            </div>
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4">
                <span class="rtx-pill rtx-pill--mint"><span class="rtx-kicker-dot"></span> Healthy</span>
                <span class="rtx-pill rtx-pill--sky">Blazor SSR</span>
                <span class="rtx-pill rtx-pill--honey">InMemory → SQL Server</span>
                <span class="rtx-pill">Serilog + HealthChecks</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-5 text-center">
            <img src="img/logo.png" alt="VTIVTECH chibi mecha" class="img-fluid rtx-float" style="max-height: 340px; background: #fff; border-radius: 24px; padding: 12px;" />
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-center gap-2 mt-3">
                <span class="rtx-gauge" title="Presión PROPANO"></span>
                <span class="rtx-gauge" title="Presión OTRO" style="transform: rotate(18deg)"></span>
                <span class="rtx-pill rtx-pill--honey">OK • ACTIVE</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="row g-3 g-lg-4">
    <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                    <span class="rtx-gauge" style="width:32px;height:32px"></span>
                    <h5 class="card-title mb-0">Arquitectura</h5>
                </div>
                <p class="card-text text-muted">Domain / Application / Infrastructure / Reporting / Web — separación limpia. Reporting desacoplado para usarlo desde Blazor, API, jobs y export.</p>
                <div class="d-flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
                    <span class="rtx-pill rtx-pill--sky">IDataSourceProvider</span>
                    <span class="rtx-pill">Query → Result</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="card h-100" style="border-top: 4px solid var(--rtx-honey)">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">Reporting Engine</h5>
                <p class="card-text text-muted"><code>DataSource → Query → QueryResult → Report → Visualization → Dashboard</code> — sin recompilar, con solo lectura.</p>
                <div class="rtx-pill rtx-pill--honey">SqlServer ✓ &nbsp; ODBC (MAPICS) próximo</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="card h-100" style="border-top: 4px solid var(--rtx-mint)">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">Próximos pasos</h5>
                <ol class="mb-0 small text-muted ps-3">
                    <li><code>dotnet user-secrets set ConnectionStrings:ConfigurationDatabase "Server=...;Database=SXA_RTX_Analytics;..."</code></li>
                    <li><code>dotnet ef migrations add Initial --project src/SXA.RTX.Analytics.Infrastructure</code></li>
                    <li>Configurar DataSources y permisos</li>
                </ol>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card mt-4">
    <div class="card-body d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 align-items-center justify-content-between">
        <div>
            <div class="fw-bold">Estado del sistema</div>
            <div class="text-muted small">Si <code>ConfigurationDatabase</code> está vacío usa InMemory. En prod usa cuenta de solo lectura.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="d-flex gap-2">
            <a href="/health" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline-primary">/health JSON</a>
            <a href="/health/live" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">/health/live</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
